  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "r0b0tlab's dual-GB10 vLLM 0.21.1 (SM120/SM121 FP4 source build) serving of NVIDIA's ModelOpt NVFP4 checkpoint of MiniMax M2.7: tensor parallel 2 over Ray, FlashInfer-CUTLASS NVFP4 GEMM and MoE, FP8 KV, torch.compile mode 3 with CUDA graphs disabled (upstream found graph replay deadlocks the cross-node shared-memory broadcast). Text and tool calling (minimax_m2 parsers), 196,608 token context, 4 sequences (upstream launch script). Licences: r0b0tlab package MIT, vLLM Apache-2.0; the NVIDIA checkpoint is under the NVIDIA Software and Model Evaluation License (information only; upstream README asks users to accept the model licence). Upstream claims about 25 tok/s single-stream decode (tg128) on two GB10; not measured here.",
